OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in M42 crash near        
OL,4,ABirmingham Airport                     
OL,6,FA man died in a serious crash on the   
OL,7,FM42 near Birmingham Airport, police    
OL,8,Fsaid.                                  
OL,10,FThe crash, involving a van and a lorry,
OL,11,Fhappened on the northbound carriageway 
OL,12,Fof the motorway between junction 5a and
OL,13,Fjunction six on Saturday, just after   
OL,14,F12:30 GMT.                             
OL,16,FThe van driver, a man in his 40s, died 
OL,17,Fat the scene, West Midlands Police     
OL,18,Fsaid.                                  
OL,20,FThe carriageway remained closed for    
OL,21,Fseveral hours but was fully reopened to
OL,22,Ftraffic earlier on Sunday morning.     
